<title>USA: U.S. DAP and ammonia prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP and ammonia prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate were steady in quiet dealings. Anhydrous ammonia values were steady on moderate sales.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		160-165		 unc</p>
<p>(na - not available, nc - no comparison)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
